 "content": "[\n {\n  \"id\": \"hdr-title\",\n  \"type\": \"header\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"text\": \"<span class=\\\"h4\\\"><b>SIRAJ Research — Registry, Geography &amp; Insights<br/>سراج للبحوث — السجل والجغرافيا والرؤى</b></span>\",\n   \"col\": 12\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"p-welcome\",\n  \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"text\": \"People, institutions, events and sources — linked to a six-level bilingual administrative geography (Country → Governorate → District → Municipality → Village → Community), offline-first. Work through the setup checklist, watch the live counts and distributions below, then explore every DocType by section.\\n\\nأشخاص ومؤسسات وأحداث ومصادر — مرتبطة بجغرافيا إدارية ثنائية اللغة من ستة مستويات (دولة ← محافظة ← منطقة ← بلدية ← قرية ← مجتمع)، أولوية دون الاتصال. ابدأ من قائمة الإعداد، وراقب العدّادات والتوزيعات أدناه، ثم استكشف كل نوع مستند حسب القسم.\",\n   \"col\": 12\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"ob-setup\",\n  \"type\": \"onboarding\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"onboarding_name\": \"SIRAJ Research Setup\",\n   \"col\": 12\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sp-1\",\n  \"type\": \"spacer\",\n  \"data\": {}\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"hdr-quicknav\",\n  \"type\": \"header\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"text\": \"<span class=\\\"h4\\\"><b>Quick navigation · التنقل السريع</b></span>\",\n   \"col\": 12\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-0\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Person\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-1\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Institution\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-2\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Place\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-3\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Siraj Event\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-4\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Relationship\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-5\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Source\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-6\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Military Unit\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-7\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"SIRAJ Settings\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-8\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"SIRAJ Explorer\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-9\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Governorate\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-10\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Boundary Dataset\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sc-11\",\n  \"type\": \"shortcut\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"shortcut_name\": \"Geo Settings\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"sp-2\",\n  \"type\": \"spacer\",\n  \"data\": {}\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"hdr-insights\",\n  \"type\": \"header\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"text\": \"<span class=\\\"h4\\\"><b>Live insights · رؤى حية</b></span>\",\n   \"col\": 12\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"nc-0\",\n  \"type\": \"number_card\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"number_card_name\": \"Total Persons\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"nc-1\",\n  \"type\": \"number_card\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"number_card_name\": \"Total Institutions\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"nc-2\",\n  \"type\": \"number_card\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"number_card_name\": \"Total Places\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"nc-3\",\n  \"type\": \"number_card\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"number_card_name\": \"Total Events\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"nc-4\",\n  \"type\": \"number_card\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"number_card_name\": \"Total Relationships\",\n   \"col\": 3\n  }\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"nc-5\",\n  \"type\": \"number_card\",\n  \"data\": {\n   \"number_card_name\": \"Total Sources\",\